{"strongs": "H2798", "word": "חָרָשׁ", "translit": "cha.ra.shim", "root": "חרש", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "graver, artificer", "definition": "חָרָשׁ noun masculine Exod 38:23 graver, artificer (Phoenician חרש ) — absolute ׳ ח (= * חַרָּשׁ ) Exod 35:35 + 14 t.; construct חָרַשׁ Exod 28:11 + 2 t.; plural חָֽרָשִׁים Hos 13:2 + 7 t.; חֲרָשִׁים 1Chr 4:14 (twice in verse); Neh 11:35 (see below); construct חָֽרָשֵׁי 2Sam 5:11 + 6 t.; — 1. graver, artificer: \\ \\ a. worker in metal 1Sam 13:19 ; Hos 8:6 ; Hos 13:2 ; Deut 27:15 ; Jer 10:9 (|| צֹרֵף ), Isa 40:19 (|| id. ), Isa 54:16 ; 1Chr 29:5 בַּרְזֶל ׳ ח Isa 44:12 ; 2Chr 24:12 perhaps also Isa 41:7 (+ צֹרֵף ); apparently = hammer Zech 2:3 (symbolic). \\ \\ b. worker in wood עֵץ ׳ ח 2Sam 5:11 = 1Chr 14:1 ( עֵצִים ), 2Kgs 12:12 ; 2Kgs 22:6 = 2Chr 34:11 ; Jer 10:3 ; Isa 40:20 ; Isa 44:13 (see also 1Chr 22:15 below); perhaps also Ezra 3:7 ; 2Chr 24:12 (both || חצב ). \\ \\ c. worker in stone אֶבֶן קִיר ׳ ח 2Sam 5:11 = 1Chr 14:1 (omitted אבן ); also of engraving on gems אבן ׳ ח Exod 28:11 ( P ; || פִּתּוּחֵי חֹתָם ); see also following \\ \\ d. in general אֶבֶן וָעֵץ ׳ ח 1Chr 22:15 idol-maker צִירִים ׳ ח Isa 45:16 , compare Isa 44:11 (also v Isa 44:12 v Isa 44:13 above), 2Kgs 24:14 ; 2Kgs 24:16 ; Jer 24:1 ; Jer 29:2 (all || מַסְגֵּר ), Exod 35:35 ; Exod 38:23 (both P ; both || חשֵׁב ). In גֵּיא חֲרָשִׁים 1Chr 4:14 , ׳ גֵּי הַחֲ Neh 11:35 valley of (the) artificers , and חֲרָשִׁים artificers 1Chr 4:14 , ח has ֲ֯ exceptionally, see Ol § 183 a Kö ii, § 60. 5 ; read חָֽרָשִׁים ? 2. figurative מַשְׁחִית ׳ ח Ezek 21:36 men skilled to destroy .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3182')\">BDB3182</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2796')\">H2796</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H1516')\">H1516</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H2798')\">H2798</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3181')\">BDB3181</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3183')\">BDB3183</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>חָרָשׁ</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Exod 38:23\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(2,38,23)\">Exod 38:23</ref></sup> <highlightword>graver, artificer</highlightword> (Phoenician <bdbheb>חרש</bdbheb>) — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> (= *<bdbheb>חַרָּשׁ</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Exod 35:35\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,35)\">Exod 35:35</ref> + 14 t.; construct <bdbheb>חָרַשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 28:11\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(2,28,11)\">Exod 28:11</ref> + 2 t.; plural <bdbheb>חָֽרָשִׁים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 13:2\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(28,13,2)\">Hos 13:2</ref> + 7 t.; <bdbheb>חֲרָשִׁים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 4:14\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(13,4,14)\">1Chr 4:14</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Neh 11:35\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(16,11,35)\">Neh 11:35</ref> (see below); construct <bdbheb>חָֽרָשֵׁי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 5:11\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(10,5,11)\">2Sam 5:11</ref> + 6 t.; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>graver, artificer:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> worker in metal <ref ref=\"1Sam 13:19\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(9,13,19)\">1Sam 13:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 8:6\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(28,8,6)\">Hos 8:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 13:2\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(28,13,2)\">Hos 13:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 27:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,27,15)\">Deut 27:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 10:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"b