\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(23,40,20)\">Isa 40:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 44:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,13)\">Isa 44:13</ref> (see also <ref ref=\"1Chr 22:15\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(13,22,15)\">1Chr 22:15</ref> below); perhaps also <ref ref=\"Ezra 3:7\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(15,3,7)\">Ezra 3:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 24:12\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(14,24,12)\">2Chr 24:12</ref> (both || <bdbheb>חצב</bdbheb>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> worker in stone <bdbheb>אֶבֶן קִיר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 5:11\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(10,5,11)\">2Sam 5:11</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Chr 14:1\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(13,14,1)\">1Chr 14:1</ref> (omitted <bdbheb>אבן</bdbheb>); also of engraving on gems <bdbheb>אבן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 28:11\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(2,28,11)\">Exod 28:11</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>; || <bdbheb>פִּתּוּחֵי חֹתָם</bdbheb>); see also following <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> in general <bdbheb>אֶבֶן וָעֵץ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 22:15\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(13,22,15)\">1Chr 22:15</ref> <highlight>idol-maker</highlight> <bdbheb>צִירִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 45:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,16)\">Isa 45:16</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Isa 44:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,11)\">Isa 44:11</ref> (also v<ref re